k"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回はメンバーへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感謝を込めて クッキーを送ろうということでいつも頑張っているメンバーへ若月特製クッキーを作りました(｀_´)ゞドヤッツツ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"喜んでくれるかな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/08/194896e9744e9b52cecee39e8d2f2d2bd13.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上の画像な具合で(・∀・∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、こちらは以前作った某菓子パンのヒーローです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/08/dcf00798.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"菓子パンのヒーロードヤッツツ(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髭が生えている１つは華麗にスルーしてください←ぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、愛してやまない桜井玲香さん。一緒に色々考えてくれたね。楽しい時、苦しい時、いつもいつも隣には玲香がいたよ。それがどんなに心強かったか。どんなに幸せだったか。いつか必ず恩返しするから待っとって。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では!!ばかつき"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/08/14f6ca825747b807f417fb19d825f86956a.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"神様は喜怒哀楽の"},{"type":"break"},{"t